            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 4 At the time of writing, an update of RFC 5216 for EAP-TLS with TLS 1.3 was still in progress. Once it has been released, this update will become applicable according to [V2G20-2244].",
